[63.468594, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe design maps cleanly onto TYPO3.\u001b[22m Eac\u001b[45G of the five layouts becomes\u001b[74Ga page layout \u001b[89Gditors can c\u001b[102Goose:\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mHome\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mSidebarLeft\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDefault\u001b[39m (full\u001b[39Gidth), \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mSidebarRight\u001b[39m and\u001b[63G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mNarrow\u001b[39m. Each needs a\u001b[84Gpage\u001b[90Gempl\u001b[95Gte\u001b[98Gwith a\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bma\u001b[8Gching name.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe header and footer become partials.\u001b[44G\u001b[22mThese\u001b[50Gare\u001b[54Gfragments\u001b[64Gof\u001b[67Gthe\u001b[71Gbody\u001b[76Gonly.\u001b[82GThe\u001b[86G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m<head>\u001b[93G\u001b[39mand\u001b[97Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m<link>\u001b[39m/\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m<script>\u001b[21G\u001b[39mtags\u001b[26Ggo\u001b[29Ginto\u001b[34Gthe\u001b[38Gpage\u001b[43Gsetup\u001b[49Gas\u001b[52G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mincludeCSS\u001b[39m/\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mincludeJS\u001b[39m.\u001b[74GThe\u001b[78Gnavigation\u001b[89Gand\u001b[93Gbreadcrumb\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcome\u001b[10Gfrom\u001b[15Gthe\u001b[19Gmenu\u001b[24Gprocessor\u001b[34Ginstead\u001b[42Gof\u001b[45Ghard-coded\u001b[56Glinks,\u001b[63Gand\u001b[67G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mlogo.svg\u001b[76G\u001b[39mis\u001b[79Gloaded\u001b[86Gvia\u001b[90G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mf:uri.resource\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSCSS build mov\u001b[24Gs in\u001b[29Galm\u001b[33Gst unchanged.\u001b[22m It goes into the package and\u001b[76Gwrites t\u001b[85G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Public/Css/m\u001b[28Gin.css\u001b[39m, with \u001b[43Ge JS in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Public/JavaScript/\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIt's readable.\u001b[20G\u001b[22mThis\u001b[25Grepo\u0