\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcome from the menu processor\u001b[34Ginste\u001b[40Gd of hard-coded links, and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mlogo.svg\u001b[39m is loaded via \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mf:uri.resource\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe SCSS build moves in almost unchanged.\u001b[22m It g\u001b[52Ges into the package and\u001b[76Gwrites to\u001b[86G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Public/Css/main.css\u001b[39m, with the JS in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Public/JavaScript/\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIt's readable.\u001b[22m This repo looks\u001b[36Gl\u001b[38Gke\u001b[41Ga staged demo (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mStage 00…02\u001b[39m), and a hand-written\u001b[89Gpackage\u001b[97Gis\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gsomething people can follow comm\u001b[38Gt by\u001b[43Gcommit.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTwo\u001b[7Gdecisions\u001b[17Gto\u001b[20Gsettle\u001b[27Gwhile\u001b[33Gsetting\u001b[41Git\u001b[44Gup:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mKeep the \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3/fluid-styled-content\u001b[39m set.\u001b[22m EXT:form,\u001b[56Gfelogin\u001b[64Gand\u001b[68Gthe\u001b[72Gsearch\u001b[79Gplugin\u001b[86Gall\u001b[90Grender\u001b[97Gthrough\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gits \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mlib.contentElement\u001b[39m. If you drop it, they render as nothi\u001b[66Gg.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mProbably drop \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfluid-styled-content-css\u001b[39m,\u001b[45G\u001b[22mbecaus\u001b[52G your SCSS should\u001b[70Gstyle\u001b[76Gthe\u001b[80Gcontent\u001b[88Gelements.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mDecisions for you before content work\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m                                     \u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
